  "description": "Preview release targeting .NET 10.\n\n          MySQL/MariaDB is currently not supported in this version due to missing EF Core provider support.\n          If you require MySQL, please use version 9.x.\n\n          EfCore.Boost adds a provider-aware Unit of Work + Repository layer on top of EF Core,\n          with utilities for routines, bulk operations, and OData support.\n\n          Designed for consistent cross-database behavior across SQL Server/Azure and PostgreSQL,\n          using conventions and explicit safety boundaries.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
