  "releaseNotes": "Preview release for .NET 10.\n\n          - MySQL/MariaDB support is temporarily unavailable due to lack of EF Core provider support.\n          - SQL Server and PostgreSQL are fully supported.\n          - MySQL support will be reintroduced once the Pomelo provider is updated for .NET 10.\n\n          Use version 9.x if MySQL support is required.",
